==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*100 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**25 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
