==Strategy==
The most difficult part of this stage is stalling the Rain Ds, which are at 600% magnification each causing them to have 540,000 health. Courier alone will not be enough to juggle them, so you need any and all units that can outrange these Rain Ds. Be careful of their high knockback count, however, as you can and most likely will easily push into the range of THE SLOTH in the back, which will obliterate your DPS stack if you're not careful enough. Money isn't an issue in this stage, as the peons are spammed to the point that they can sufficiently maintain your wallet at around 2000-3000 cents.

Once the Rain Ds are dead, simply finish off THE SLOTH.

==Trivia==
*Frontier Dawn is a reversal of Dawn Frontier, a direct translation of [[Frontier Spirit]]'s Japanese name (暁フロンティア ''Akatsuki Furontia'').
**Frontier Dawn and Dawn Frontier may be referencing the ''dōjin'' game developer [[wikipedia:Twilight Frontier|Twilight Frontier]] (黄昏フロンティア ''Tasogare Furontia''), as dawn is the opposite of twilight.

